{"4953620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crazy Road Shop Wars", "steam_appid": 4953620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the worst supermarket in town! Manage your store, serve furious customers, and do whatever it takes to drive your rivals out of business.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your shop, your rules.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953620/extras/c01eb2a2d4c697c5015ede4af1ac3e66.poster.avif?t=1786657819\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953620/extras/c01eb2a2d4c697c5015ede4af1ac3e66.webm?t=1786657819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953620/extras/c01eb2a2d4c697c5015ede4af1ac3e66.mp4?t=1786657819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your store to stand out on the street. Just remember - a fancy storefront won't save you from furious customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Customer Service</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan groceries at lightning speed. And if customers don't like the total? You've always got a baseball bat under the counter to handle complaints. Just don't let the shoplifters get away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Manager's Tough Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953620/extras/44a961b710ce126b4dde841ff01b30b7.poster.avif?t=1786657819\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953620/extras/44a961b710ce126b4dde841ff01b30b7.webm?t=1786657819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953620/extras/44a961b710ce126b4dde841ff01b30b7.mp4?t=1786657819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order new products, unpack deliveries, and keep your shelves fully stocked. Just make sure your neighbors don't steal your merchandise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧍‍♂️ 4-Player Rivalry: Every player for themselves! Run your own shop and forge fragile alliances to mercilessly crush the competition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛒 Store Management: Bread, drinks, tomatoes... stock whatever your customers are craving. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😤 Advanced AI: Customers have their own moods, budgets, and... they can completely lose their temper. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌃 Day &amp; Night Cycle: Earn money during the day and unlock new items at night.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the worst supermarket in town! Manage your store, serve furious customers, and do whatever it takes to drive your rivals out of business.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your shop, your rules.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953620/extras/c01eb2a2d4c697c5015ede4af1ac3e66.poster.avif?t=1786657819\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953620/extras/c01eb2a2d4c697c5015ede4af1ac3e66.webm?t=1786657819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953620/extras/c01eb2a2d4c697c5015ede4af1ac3e66.mp4?t=1786657819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></spa