 and unlock new items at night.</p>", "short_description": "Run your own shop, compete against rival store owners, and sabotage the competition in this chaotic online multiplayer shop management game. Stock shelves, set prices, unlock new products, and do whatever it takes to become the ultimate retail king.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Czech, Danish, Finnish, Spanish - Latin America, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Swedish, Turkish, Ukrainian, Bulgarian, Greek, Indonesian, Malay, Romanian, Thai, Vietnamese, Hungarian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953620/6e3e4fa0537c69825a3c52aabd73ffeebacb9dfc/header.jpg?t=1786657819", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953620/aaa45465d0b24e2f75a69d91395daf6f0c9ee24d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786657819", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4953620/aaa45465d0b24e2f75a69d91395daf6f0c9ee24d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786657819", "website": "https://discord.gg/xsx56QywRz", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-10600K / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 / AMD RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>Dir